# enabled by default (Cargo.toml: `default = []`) and is not built by this
# port. Its crates are still listed below because they are present in
# the upstream Cargo.lock (cargo resolves optional-dependency crates into
# the lockfile regardless of which features are active) and `cargo.crates`
# vendors from the lockfile, not from the enabled feature set.

